"Prioritizes heap release records within the existing capacity. M4 tests found no confirmed performance or net memory benefit." = "优先保留堆释放记录，容量不变；M4 测试未确认性能或净内存收益。";

"Continue passes across depth/stencil layout changes" = "延续深度／模板布局切换通道";
"Only merges compatible read-only-to-write transitions. Keeps feedback, query and synchronization guards. Performance benefit is unconfirmed." = "仅合并兼容的只读转写入通道；保留反馈、遮挡和同步检查，实测收益尚未确认。";

"ARM64 renderer host" = "ARM64 渲染宿主";
"Runs the renderer in a native process; the game still uses Rosetta. About 6% faster in the matched M4 test." = "渲染器在原生进程中运行，游戏仍使用 Rosetta。M4 同场景对照约提升 6%。";

"Reuse identical Metal libraries" = "复用相同着色器库";
"Reuses identical libraries within the running renderer. Separate from automatic disk preparation; benefit is unconfirmed." = "复用运行中渲染器的相同库；不控制自动磁盘准备，收益待确认。";

// Runtime capabilities
"This runtime requires a native ARM64 Metal renderer host." = "此运行时需要原生 ARM64 Metal 渲染宿主。";
"Metal libraries are prepared on this Mac when needed; unchanged results are reused." = "需要时在本机准备 Metal 库；无变化时直接复用。";

"This ARM64 runtime currently supports Metal only." = "此 ARM64 运行时目前仅支持 Metal。";

"Reuse recent DeviceLocal staging blocks" = "复用最近的 DeviceLocal 暂存块";
"Tries recently used DeviceLocal staging blocks first. Capacity and completion fences are unchanged; performance benefit is unconfirmed." = "优先尝试最近使用的 DeviceLocal 暂存块。容量和完成栅栏保持不变，性能收益尚未确认。";

"The ARM64 runtime is incomplete or has the wrong architecture." = "ARM64 运行时不完整或组件架构不符。";

